  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/RyosSplitter/Wrestler-Importer/zipball/portable-preview-25-32317d1949c71193be542ab16ad4faec1c3c040e",
  "body": "PS2PSP v0.25.4 Windows x64 preview. Adds opt-in Maximum Downgrade: frozen Default geometry candidate, automatic sub-64 native-observed texture reductions and useful-color reductions, exact non-texture preservation, measured PAC budget and sampled-alpha checks. Existing modes remain unchanged. Adds a Textures section with Default (best for most models), ATO, Priority Selection (source previews, up to three priorities), and Downgrade (one, two or three halving steps with a 64-pixel floor). Default remains the startup mode. Default/ATO algorithms and accepted baselines are unchanged; the UI modes are mutually exclusive. Priorities report remaining reductions. Downgrade enforces actual serialized PAC size and conservative baseline padded pixels/CLUT allocation; it withholds settings that cannot fit rather than silently lowering the floor or changing geometry. Reports preserve decisions and failure diagnostics. Includes scalp compatibility, complete head QA, Windows 7-style interface, bundled Blender, sources and notices; no game assets. Requires your own supported PSP base and Windows 10/11 x64. No main merge; PPSSPP validation required.\r\n"
